{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 25, :comments ["<b>A covenant of vengeance.</b> Therefore I said that this is the covenant cut at Sinai, written in the section \"These are the ordinances,\" the day they accepted it upon themselves and said \"We will do and we will hear\" — then the covenant was cut. And He said to them this entire passage." "<b>And you shall be gathered to your cities.</b> Because of the sword, and there I will send pestilence and famine, until you desire to be given into the enemy's hand. And this is the meaning of <b>and you shall be given into the enemy's hand</b> — and it is a word in the nif'al binyan."], :book :leviticus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 26, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:12:44.085287008Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}